{"repositoryId":1072562851,"availability":"available","full":"AleksaSovrlic/majstorsada","name":"majstorsada","description":"Production Nuxt/Firebase platform for urgent home-service requests in Belgrade.","category":"Other","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2025-10-08T22:38:27Z","updated":"2026-10-17T15:26:28Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://majstorsada.rs","topics":["firebase","firebase-functions","nuxt","pwa","seo","service-marketplace","ssr","typescript","vue"],"demo":"https://majstorsada.rs/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.549Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.549Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.549Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.549Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Production Nuxt/Firebase marketplace for urgent home-service requests in Belgrade.","MajstorSada is a solo-built marketplace product that helps customers submit one repair request instead of calling many individual tradespeople. A customer chooses a service category, sends a request, and the platform routes it to currently available verified tradespeople. The tradesperson who accepts the intervention contacts the customer directly to agree on price, arrival, and work details before the job starts.","Urgent home repairs are stressful because customers often do not know who is available, who covers their type of problem, or how many phone numbers they will need to call before someone answers."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AleksaSovrlic/majstorsada/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f5b5503ae2413af45dbd45f66652f2d14295b7c9abff2627f7ccd97584395b32","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.653Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T22:45:12.653Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Production Nuxt/Firebase marketplace for urgent home-service requests in Belgrade.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AleksaSovrlic/majstorsada/bl